  "description": "While trying to hide the fact that he’s an alpha, Hayden is approached by Brett for help on a class project. However, it turns out that Brett is not only a fellow alpha, but one that doesn’t use scent blockers. The two naturally butt heads and continue as a series of unsettling encounters unfold...until Brett takes things one step too far.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/unpleasant)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/scent), [Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/huyukai), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/unpleasant), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/unpleasant), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dbd_00326), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/bt_1110954), [Spanish](https://www.lezhin.es/detail/un-aroma-inquietante)\n\n***Note:** All official translations are uncensored, except for German and Japanese.*",
